Flat 324 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Optima 1 BHK Flat 324 sq.ft\")\n\n## Ruparel Optima Floor Plans & Pricing\n\n![Ruparel Optima 1 BHK 323 sq.ft floor plan](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Optima 1 BHK 323 sq.ft floor plan\")\n![image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"image\")\n\n## Properties in Ruparel Optima\n\n![Ruparel Optima 1 BHK Flat 322 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Optima 1 BHK Flat 322 sq.ft\")\n![Ruparel Optima 1 BHK Flat 300 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Optima 1 BHK Flat 300 sq.ft\")\n![Ruparel Optima 1 BHK Flat 330 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Optima 1 BHK Flat 330 sq.ft\")\n![Ruparel Optima 1 BHK Flat 235 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Optima 1 BHK Flat 235 sq.ft\")\n![Ruparel Optima 1 BHK Flat 323 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Optima 1 BHK Flat 323 sq.ft\")\n![Ruparel Optima 1 BHK Flat 233 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Optima 1 BHK Flat 233 sq.ft\")\n![Ruparel Optima 1 BHK Flat 550 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Optima 1 BHK Flat 550 sq.ft\")\n![Ruparel Optima 1 BHK Flat 324 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Optima 1 BHK Flat 324 sq.ft\")\n\n## About Ruparel Optima Mumbai\n\n## Ruparel Optima Mumbai Top Amenities\n\nOverview\n\nRuparel Optima located in Kandivali West, Mumbai is a well-crafted township. It has a number of apartments available between Rs. 63.3 Lac Onwards.   \nRuparel Optima in Kandivali West, Mumbai by Ruparel Realty is an iconic landmark offering $unit residential apartments of 1BHK units. There are a total of 3 magnificent towers with 22 storeys & 40 storey and each of the meticulously designed units are available on sale.  \n  \nAbout the Project  \n   \nRuparel Optima in Kandivali West, Mumbai is developed on 25 acres of prime land and offers luxurious and fully-furnished 1BHK residential apartments that are perfect from investment point of view as well as for those seeking to move into their own abode.  \n   \nThese well ventilated residential apartments are extremely spacious and receive plenty of natural light all throughout the day. These plush 1BHK flats are bestowed with premium fixtures and furnishings, large balconies and windows providing gorgeous views, attractive décor and enhanced security features. There is a splendidly designed clubhouse, swimming pool, jogging track, landscaped gardens, kids play area, gym etc.  \n   \nRuparel Optima also boasts a prime location, as it is 2 minutes away from the upcoming metro station and 5 minutes from the proposed Kandivali – Nariman Point Coastal Road. Schools and hospitals such as Ryan International School and Zenith Hospital are hardly 10 minutes and 13 minutes away. Kandivali Railway Station is also only a short 9 minutes away while Infinity Mall in Malad is about 13 minutes away.\n\nHighpoints\n\nRuparel Optima has many interesting features to boast of, however, one of the main USPs of this project are the 1BHK fully furnished apartments offering every enviable luxury and comfort to enjoy a modern lifestyle. If you have been looking to invest in 1BHK unit that is luxurious yet spacious then look no further, as buying a flat in Ruparel Optima is the right choice for you.\n\n## Ruparel Optima Kandivali West Mumbai\n\n### Key Facts & USPs\n\n| Feature | Details |\n| --- | --- |\n| Project Key USPs | Fully furnished, air-conditioned 1 BHK smart homes; multi-storeyed iconic towers; world-class club life avenues; landscaped lifestyle features; elegant lift lobbies with high-speed branded elevators; 3-tier security with CCTV surveillance; retail and commercial centres |\n| Structure Details | 3 towers with G+2C+40 floors; construction ongoing |\n| Electrical Systems | Power backup; high-speed elevators; intercom facility; video phone; 24x7 water supply |\n| Location Advantages | Prime West Mumbai location; close to Sanjay Gandhi National Park; excellent connectivity to major roads and public transport; vibrant neighborhood with dining, shopping, and entertainment options |\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Ruparel Optima Price | Rs. 63.3 Lac Onwards |\n| Property Types | Flat |\n| Project Type | Residential |\n| Ruparel Optima Status | Ready To Move |\n| Ruparel Optima Launch Date | 01 October 2017 |\n| Ruparel Optima Possession Date | 01 December 2025 |\n| Towers in Ruparel Optima | 3 |\n\n### Ruparel Optima Floor Plan\n\n| Unit Configuration | Unit Size |\n| --- | --- |\n| Ruparel Optima 1 BHK Flat | 323 Sq. Ft. |\n\n### How is the Kandivali West Real Estate Market?\n\n## Ratings & Reviews for Ruparel Optima\n\n![map image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"map image\")\n\n## Landmarks near Ruparel Optima\n\n## Price Trend for Ruparel Optima Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n| Project vs Locality Price | Apr-June'26 | Jan-Mar'26 | Oct-Dec'25 | Jul-Sept'25 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Ruparel Optima | ₹ 14753 / sq.ft | ₹ 14753 / sq.ft | ₹ 14753 / sq.ft | ₹ 14753 / sq.ft |\n| Charkop Rakesh Co. Op. Hsg. Soceity Ltd. | ₹ 14688 / sq.ft | ₹ 14688 / sq.ft | ₹ 14688 / sq.ft | ₹ 14688 / sq.ft |\n| Gagangiri Aadhya | ₹ 15516 / sq.ft1% | ₹ 15498 / sq.ft1% | ₹ 15370 / sq.ft | ₹ 15370 / sq.ft |\n| Kandivali West | ₹ 20774 / sq.ft2% | ₹ 20279 / sq.ft6% | ₹ 19054 / sq.ft-3% | ₹ 19693 / sq.ft-6% |\n\n## Ruparel Optima Photos & Videos\n\n![Ruparel Optima photos 1](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Optima photos 1\")\n![Ruparel Optima photos 2](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Optima photos 2\")\n![Ruparel Optima photos 3](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Optima photos 3\")\n![Ruparel Optima photos 4](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Optima photos 4\")\n![Ruparel Optima photos 5](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Optima photos 5\")\n![Ruparel Optima photos 6](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Optima photos 6\")\n![Ruparel Optima photos 7](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Optima photos 7\")\n![Ruparel Optima photos 8](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Optima photos 8\")\n![Ru