ent Near Marine Lines\n\n📅 28 Sep 2026](/news/2001893/dhuleva-plans-1-000-crore-redevelopment-near-marine-lines)[![BMC Begins Fresh Sea-Level Risk Assessment for Mumbai](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/a5490eaafe8c.png)\n\nArticles\n\nBMC Begins Fresh Sea-Level Risk Assessment for Mumbai\n\n📅 07 Sep 2026](/news/2001930/bmc-begins-fresh-sea-level-risk-assessment-for-mumbai)[![MahaRERA Orders L&T to Fix Defects at Crescent Bay Parel](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/499075ce4cdd.png)\n\nArticles\n\nMahaRERA Orders L&T to Fix Defects at Crescent Bay Parel\n\n📅 07 Sep 2026](/news/2001927/maharera-orders-l-t-to-fix-defects-at-crescent-bay-parel)[![GIS maps to be attached to sale deeds from October in Maharashtra](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/8d8e7c8b42a9.png)\n\nArticles\n\nGIS maps to be attached to sale deeds from October in Maharashtra\n\n📅 05 Sep 2026](/news/2001922/gis-maps-to-be-attached-to-sale-deeds-from-october-in-maharashtra)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_ruparel-optima-kandivali-west_3068.html","title":"Ruparel Optima Kandivali West Mumbai - Price, Location, Possession, Reviews, Investor Flats, Resale Flats | Property Crow","raw_content":"![PropertyCrow.com](/propertycrow-logo-sm.svg)\n\n1. [New Projects](https://www.propertycrow.com/)\n›2. [New Projects in Mumbai](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/property_residential-projects_1_1_0_0_0.html)\n›3. [New Projects in Kandivali West](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/property_new-projects-in-kandivali-west_1_1_0_0_90.html)\n›4. [Ruparel Optima](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_ruparel-optima-kandivali-west_3068.html)\n\n![Ruparel Optima](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3068/photo-22599.jpeg)\n\n![Ruparel Optima](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3068/photo-22599.jpeg)\n\n![Ruparel Optima - living area](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3068/photo-22600.jpeg)\n\n![Ruparel Optima - location map](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3068/photo-22601.jpeg)\n\n![Ruparel Optima - location map](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3068/photo-22601.jpeg)\n\nby Ruparel Realty\n\n# Ruparel Optima\n\nMahatma Gandhi Nagar, Mumbai\n\nConfig: 1 BHK Apartments\n\nSize 323 Sq.ft Carpet Area\n\nPrice ₹85 Lakhs\\*\n\nCall Now +919769025551\n\n**Code:** PropertyCrow3068\n\nPossession Status Possession Expected Around December 2021\n\nRERA P51800013701  \n[View RERA QR Code](#qr)\n\nAbout Project\n\n## RUPAREL OPTIMA\n\n**Ruparel Optima** is a housing cum industrial project designed by Ruparel Realty. The project provides well designed stores and 1 BHK flats at very inexpensive costs. The project is well linked by many modes of transport. The site is in close distance to many civic programs. It offers 1 BHK with startin\n\ng area from 323 Sq.ft. The project well organized with all the choices to finish the demands of the individuals.\n\n1 of 43 Storeys  \nFully-Furnished Air-Conditioned 1 BHK Optimum-Space Residences\\*  \nGrand Clubhouse With Pool & Gym  \nLush Designer Landscaped Gardens  \nLocated With Easy Access To Upcoming Metro & Coastal Road  \nSelect High Street retail Avenues\n\n**Advantage of Location:**\n\nKandivali West is a suburban area situated at the junction of Mahatma Gandhi Road and Link Road. It homes many well-known places like Nagar, Kandivali village, M G Road, Link Road, Shankar Lane and Charkop which have completed massive improvement in the past few years. From an farming land to a residential hot spot, this area has appeared as a vibrant real estate location providing good connection to industrial hubs such as Bandra Kurla Complex (BKC), Goregaon and Andheri. Kandivali West offers outstanding road and rail connection through Mulund - Goregaon Link Road, Malad - Andheri Link Road and Western Highway. Places like schools, colleges, institutes, malls, shopping centres, cafes, restaurants, clubs, pubs, markets, general stores, banks, ATMs, healthcare centres, nursing homes, all kinds of public transportation and a lot more can be accessibility in the quickest amount of time achievable.\n\nRuparel Realty is one name that satisfies all your demands by such as modification for its customers. The builders endeavor for becoming the most appealing and dynamic real estate firm. With an aim to offer top-notch solutions and transform desires to reality, the designer group styles projects that help them do that. Development, trust, superior client service, determination and commitment to supply the best and on time is what creates them stand a part from the rest. The builders create sure that each of their assignments has development that is par quality, world class state-of-the-art features, eco-friendly residing and working areas and an absolute value for money. The builders have made useful trust and company assurance in clients.\n\n**For more details you may please contact us.**\n\nType, Area & Price\n\n## Price List\n\n| Type | Size | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | 323 Sq.ft Carpet Area | 75.00 Lacs |\n\n**Note:** Above Mentioned Sizes and Prices are Approximate, Maintenance, Club Charges, Registration, Stamp duty, Car Parking, etc as applicable. **\\*Rates are indicative.**\n\nAmenities\n\n## Project Amenities\n\n**Community Amenities :**   \n\\* Garden   \n\\* Club House   \n\\* Cafeteria   \n  \n**Health & Fitness :**   \n\\* Swimming Pool   \n\\* Gymnasium   \n  \n**Others :**   \n\\* Air Conditioning   \n\\* Car Parking   \n\\* Cctv   \n\\* Fire Safty   \n\\* Indoor Games   \n\\* Joggers Track   \n\\* Lift   \n\\* Security   \n\\* Senior Citizen Corner\n\nSpecifications\n\n## Project Specifications\n\n\\* Fully furnished air-conditioned 1 BHK studio apartments  \n\n\\* All apartments with washing machine, TV, cable and telephone split air-\n\nconditioner in living room and bedroom\n\n\\* Elegant living spaces with vitrified flooring  \n\\* Aluminum sliding French windows  \n\\* Spacious bedrooms with sliding windows  \n\\* Modular kitchens  \n\n\\* Bathrooms with branded sanitary ware, exhaust fans and anti-skid tiles\n\nvideo-door phone in each apartment\n\n\\* Concealed wiring with adequate points for all home appliances\n\nFloor Plans\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](/floor-plan.jpg)\n\n🔒 Submit enquiry to unlock floor plan\n\nRERA Details\n\n## RERA QR Code\n\n![](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3068/qra_1967.png)\n\n**RERA No:** P51800013701\n\n**Developer:** Ruparel Realty\n\n**Project:** Ruparel Optima\n\n[Verify on MahaRERA Website →](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nLocation\n\n## Location & Nearby\n\nMap - Mahatma Gandhi Nagar, Mumbai\n\n**Address:** Mahatma Gandhi Nagar, Mumbai\n\n**Close To:** Mahatma Gandhi Nagar , New Link Road & Shanti Nagar\n\nFAQ\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions about RUPAREL OPTIMA\n\nWhere is Ruparel Optima Exactly located?\n\nRuparel Optima is located at Mahatma Gandhi Nagar, .\n\nIs Ruparel Optima Rera Registered?\n\nYes, It is RERA Registered with Rera Number P51800013701. You can verify the details on the official RERA website.\n\nWhat are unit options available in Ruparel Optima?\n\nRuparel Optima offers 1 BHK Apartments.\n\nWhat is the starting price of Flats in Ruparel Optima?\n\nThe starting price of Flats at Ruparel Optima is 85 Lakhs\\*. Contact us for the latest pricing and offers.\n\nWhen is the Possession of Flats?\n\nThe expected possession date for Ruparel Optima is Possession Expected Around December 2021.\n\nWhat are the nearest landmarks?\n\nKey landmarks near Ruparel Optima include Shopre Stop, Mahesh fine dine Restaurants & Bar, Kandivali Railway Station, Niranjan Majithay Degree College, Oscar Hospital, SBI Bank ATM, Charkop Police Station & RNA Park.\n\nIs Ruparel Optima, approved by Banks for Home Loans?\n\nYes, Ruparel Optima is approved by leading banks and financial institutions for home loans. Contact us for assistance with your home loan application.\n\n## Share This Project\n\nSimilar 